
                       How to use UserBirthdays.rexx
                      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Introduction:

   This script generates two bulletins about your users birthdays.  One
shows who has a birthday in the current month, the other shows who has one
in the next seven days.

Installation:

 - Copy UserBirthdays.rexx Zeus:Rexx/

 - Copy UBDays Zeus:Bin/

Running:

   Execute this script once a day (from a Cron preferably) and it'll
generate Zeus:Text/BDays.txt and Zeus:Text/7Days.txt:

   rx Zeus:Rexx/UserBirthdays.rexx

Notes:

   If anyone fancies reworking the script to produce a nicer output, feel
free!  But I'd appriciate a copy of the revised script ;)

Chars, al.
